# Purpose
Explains the plus-button reveal row, its exact card order and click/hold roles,
the prompt input, full composer launcher, and send button.

# Dependencies
- `ask-an-agent-to-open-the-right-ui.md`
- `understand-the-status-bar.md`

# Gotchas
- Keep action order, labels, and guidance target names synchronized with the dashboard.
- Native camera, gallery, file, and clipboard choices still require a user gesture.
- Image attachment starts at the plus control; paperclip controls belong to other prompt-context attachment flows and must not be named in image instructions.
